{
 "case:accusation.methods.0": "Sprinkled peanut flour onto the curry and swapped his pens for useless ones",
 "case:accusation.methods.1": "Spooned a peanut-laced condiment into the curry and swapped his pens for useless ones",
 "case:accusation.methods.2": "Sprinkled peanut immunotherapy powder onto the curry and swapped his pens for useless ones",
 "case:accusation.methods.3": "Crumbled a peanut snack over the curry and swapped his pens for useless ones",
 "case:accusation.motives.0": "To collect the life insurance on Jonah’s life",
 "case:accusation.motives.1": "Revenge for the one-star review that ruined a restaurant",
 "case:accusation.motives.2": "So that Lena would be free to leave him",
 "case:accusation.motives.3": "To stop Jonah exposing his extortion of restaurants",
 "case:accusation.motives.4": "To inherit Jonah’s money through his sister",
 "case:accusation.proofLabels.0": "The alibi that wasn’t",
 "case:accusation.proofLabels.1": "The means — from the killer’s own home",
