 "case:hints.h_laptop.levels.2": "Ask Lena whether you may look at Jonah’s laptop.",
 "case:hints.h_lena.levels.0": "Lena says she walked in at ten to ten. Did she?",
 "case:hints.h_lena.levels.1": "The building’s door log records every code, and the courier saw someone downstairs.",
 "case:hints.h_lena.levels.2": "Challenge Lena’s ‘pilates until 21:30’ statement with the building door log (or Mihai’s statement about the woman with the yoga mat).",
 "case:hints.h_lena_cleared.levels.0": "Lena had the codes, a motive and the chance. Can you rule her out?",
 "case:hints.h_lena_cleared.levels.1": "Owen records every class he teaches.",
 "case:hints.h_lena_cleared.levels.2": "Answer ‘No — she is on camera in Owen’s flat at 21:19 and 21:24’, with the recording of Owen’s class and your ‘Five minutes in the shower’ deduction.",
 "case:hints.h_logs.levels.0": "The building’s doors keep a record too.",
 "case:hints.h_logs.levels.1": "Someone in the building has the admin login. Read the notice board.",
 "case:hints.h_logs.levels.2": "Ask Owen Hart who can see the building’s door records.",
 "case:hints.h_marcus_alibi.levels.0": "Someone else lives in the house where Alfie’s medicine is kept.",
 "case:hints.h_marcus_alibi.levels.1": "Ask Marcus where he was on Thursday night.",
 "case:hints.h_marcus_alibi.levels.2": "Interrogate Marcus Doyle and ask him where he was on Thursday night.",
 "case:hints.h_marcus_home.levels.0": "Marcus now says he never left his garden office. Did he?",
 "case:hints.h_marcus_home.levels.1": "The Doyles’ front door has a camera.",
 "case:hints.h_marcus_home.levels.2": "In the Doyles’ House, examine the video doorbell, then challenge Marcus’s ‘garden office’ statement with it.",
 "case:hints.h_marcus_inbox.levels.0": "Marcus says half the team used Jonah’s inbox.",
