 "case:hints.h_marcus_run.levels.0": "You know Marcus didn’t run. Tell him so.",
 "case:hints.h_marcus_run.levels.1": "Your deductions are cards too.",
 "case:hints.h_marcus_run.levels.2": "Challenge Marcus’s ‘running round Victoria Park’ statement with your ‘Somebody else’s run’ deduction, or the family chat.",
 "case:hints.h_marcus_thambi.levels.0": "Marcus says the Thambi video was Jonah’s idea.",
 "case:hints.h_marcus_thambi.levels.1": "Read the last messages between them.",
 "case:hints.h_marcus_thambi.levels.2": "Challenge Marcus’s ‘Jonah’s idea, not mine’ statement with the messages between Jonah and Marcus.",
 "case:hints.h_marcus_walk.levels.0": "Marcus swears he never went near The Ropeworks.",
 "case:hints.h_marcus_walk.levels.1": "Someone on the towpath saw who came in by the bike store, and something from Flat 3 ended up in his own house.",
 "case:hints.h_marcus_walk.levels.2": "Challenge Marcus’s ‘never went near The Ropeworks’ statement with the pens in the sharps bin, or the narrowboat owner’s statement.",
 "case:hints.h_mihai.levels.0": "The courier says he’s ‘Andrei P.’.",
 "case:hints.h_mihai.levels.1": "Look at the profile photo on the proof-of-delivery screen.",
 "case:hints.h_mihai.levels.2": "Challenge Mihai’s ‘I am Andrei P.’ statement with the proof-of-delivery photo.",
 "case:hints.h_old_pens.levels.0": "A child’s adrenaline pens, eighteen months out of date. Who keeps pens like that?",
 "case:hints.h_old_pens.levels.1": "Ask Hannah whether she keeps spare pens, then look in the Doyles’ coat cupboard.",
 "case:hints.h_old_pens.levels.2": "In the Doyles’ House, examine the coat cupboard.",
 "case:hints.h_owen.levels.0": "Owen says he was on his own all evening.",
 "case:hints.h_owen.levels.1": "Someone else says otherwise.",
 "case:hints.h_owen.levels.2": "Challenge Owen’s ‘on my own’ statement with Lena’s admission (or Mihai’s statement about the woman with the yoga mat).",
 "case:hints.h_owen_class.levels.0": "Owen teaches online. Was anything recorded at 21:19?",
 "case:hints.h_owen_class.levels.1": "Owen records every class he teaches.",
 "case:hints.h_owen_class.levels.2": "Ask Owen whether you may see the recording of his class.",
 "case:hints.h_pens.levels.0": "The police say Jonah’s pens were out of date. Were they his pens at all?",
 "case:hints.h_pens.levels.1": "Read the dose printed on the empty tubes. Then find out what dose he was prescribed, and when he last collected new pens.",
 "case:hints.h_pens.levels.2": "Answer ‘Someone swapped his new pens for old, weaker ones’, with the empty pen tubes and the pharmacy bag (or Lena’s statement about his new pens).",
 "case:hints.h_priya_fee.levels.0": "Priya says nobody from Jonah’s side contacted her before the review.",
 "case:hints.h_priya_fee.levels.1": "One of the screenshots on Jonah’s laptop was sent to Thambi.",
 "case:hints.h_priya_fee.levels.2": "Challenge Priya’s ‘nobody from Jonah’s side ever contacted me’ statement with the screenshot of the message to Thambi.",
 "case:hints.h_priya_oil.levels.0": "Your client swears nothing in her kitchen contains nuts.",
 "case:hints.h_priya_oil.levels.1": "Something was hidden at the back of her dry store.",
 "case:hints.h_priya_oil.levels.2": "Challenge Priya’s ‘nothing in my kitchen contains nuts’ statement with the jar of chilli crisp.",
 "case:hints.h_run.levels.0": "Compare Thursday’s run with every other run Marcus has posted.",
 "case:hints.h_run.levels.1": "Compare Thursday’s numbers with his other runs on the family iPad, and re-read Evie’s message.",
 "case:hints.h_run.levels.2": "Answer ‘No — Evie ran it, wearing his watch’, with Marcus’s running app (or his month of runs) and the Doyle family chat.",
 "case:hints.h_sachet.levels.0": "Whoever spiked the curry stood at the kitchen island. Did they leave anything behind?",
 "case:hints.h_sachet.levels.1": "Get down on the floor around the island.",
 "case:hints.h_sachet.levels.2": "In Jonah’s Flat, examine the floor under the kitchen island.",
 "case:hints.h_scene.levels.0": "Start where it happened. Have you been over Jonah’s flat properly?",
 "case:hints.h_scene.levels.1": "Look at the takeaway bag, at what the paramedics left on the rug, and at the front door.",
 "case:hints.h_scene.levels.2": "In Jonah’s Flat, examine the takeaway bag, the rug and the door keypad.",
 "case:hints.h_shakedown.levels.0": "Jonah was going to post something on Monday morning. What, and about whom?",
 "case:hints.h_shakedown.levels.1": "Read the draft and the screenshot beside it. Then find out who ran his business inbox.",
 "case:hints.h_shakedown.levels.2": "Answer ‘That restaurants were being shaken down for money in his name’, with the draft video RECEIPTS and the screenshot of the message to Thambi (or the messages between Jonah and Marcus).",
 "case:hints.h_source.levels.0": "Peanut protein, 300 mg, ‘open and mix into food’. Who in this case is prescribed something like that?",
 "case:hints.h_source.levels.1": "Ask Hannah whether anyone else in the family has Jonah’s allergy, and look in the Doyles’ kitchen cupboard.",
 "case:hints.h_source.levels.2": "Answer ‘A sachet of Alfie’s peanut immunotherapy’, with the torn foil corner and Alfie’s medicine box (or Hannah’s statement about his treatment).",
 "case:hints.h_spiked.levels.0": "Read the lab report closely. Where exactly in the curry was the peanut?",
 "case:hints.h_spiked.levels.1": "Now look at the state of the bag when it reached Jonah’s door, and at 21:17.",
 "case:hints.h_spiked.levels.2": "On the board, answer ‘Someone sprinkled it on after the curry was delivered’, with the food lab report (or the Thambi bag) and Jonah’s last stories (or the proof-of-delivery photo).",
 "case:hints.h_timeline.levels.0": "Every event of Thursday night is now on the record. Can you put them in order?",
 "case:hints.h_timeline.levels.1": "Open the timeline in your Notebook. Anchor the events whose times you know, then reason about the rest.",
 "case:hints.h_timeline.levels.2": "The true order: Priya seals the bag, Marcus and Evie go out, Lena goes to Owen’s, the delivery, Jonah’s 21:17 story, the guest code, the curry spiked, the first spoonful, the 999 call, Evie’s message, Marcus home.",
 "case:hints.h_towpath.levels.0": "Someone came in by the bike store at 21:18. Did anyone see them?",
 "case:hints.h_towpath.levels.1": "Somebody lives on the canal right behind The Ropeworks.",
 "case:hints.h_towpath.levels.2": "In The Ropeworks, examine the narrowboat. Then answer ‘Marcus, in his reflective running jacket’, with the narrowboat owner’s statement and your ‘Somebody else’s run’ deduction.",
 "case:hints.h_window.levels.0": "If the curry was spiked in the flat, someone was in the flat. When?",
 "case:hints.h_window.levels.1": "Jonah told his followers what he was doing at 21:17. What does the front door say happened next?",
 "case:hints.h_window.levels.2": "Answer ‘Between 21:19 and 21:24, while Jonah was in the shower’, with the smart lock history (or the building door log) and Jonah’s last stories (or Owen’s statement about the pipes).",
 "case:locations.building.art.props.0.label": "Main entrance",
 "case:locations.building.art.props.1.label": "Entry panel",
 "case:locations.building.art.props.2.label": "Front hall",
 "case:locations.building.art.props.3.label": "Flat 1",
 "case:locations.building.art.props.4.label": "Main stairs",
 "case:locations.building.art.props.5.label": "Post boxes",
 "case:locations.building.art.props.6.label": "Bike store",
